  "description": "XIYNIF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C85 H106 N3 Nd9 O53,C1 H4 O1,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd7 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd8 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd9 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 17 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.620-4.375 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.08-134.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd9L1(L2)2(OAc)15(OH)8(H2O)2(DMF)](CH3OH)2(H2O)2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 15 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
